      "committedDate": "2026-10-08T02:25:27Z",
      "messageBody": "The upstream workflow limits each job to ten minutes. Cache residual and\nlabel verdicts by canonical basis (same checks, entry/exit checks now also\nrequire full label validity), and let the patch generator recompute only\nthe counts and witness instead of the full finite checks, which\nscripts/complex_network.py and the tests already run. The certificate drops\nits diagnostic count of distinct cached checks; the patch is unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
      "messageHeadline": "perf: cache complex label checks for CI time",
      "oid": "dfe5b818aad4d386cb5dd7d76df108088107765d"
    },
