      "committedDate": "2026-10-08T05:08:07Z",
      "messageBody": "- Feed each center wire from its group total inside the side circuit:\n  it rises only to the star span H_i, so it loses h-1 instead of h\n  dimensions per invocation in both stage directions\n- Align the paired blocks across common points and share each top-level\n  pair-star chain between its two groups: 494196 roles vs 509244\n- Bit saving 296/10^11 -> 325/10^11; witness 1479 -> 1624/10^12\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
